MamaCare

Backend (FastAPI, Python 3.14 via uv):
  cd mamacare-backend && cp .env.example .env   # set JWT_SECRET_KEY and GROQ_API_KEY
  uv sync && uv run uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000

The database is migrated automatically on startup (alembic/). An older database
made before migrations is upgraded in place. Add a change with:
  uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "what changed"
Tests:  cd mamacare-backend && uv run pytest

Care circle: a mother invites a partner, family member or doctor from the API
(POST /api/care/invites). The invite link is /?invite=TOKEN on the frontend.

Frontend (React + Vite):
  cd mamacare-frontend && npm install
  npm run dev        # http://localhost:4173, talks to http://127.0.0.1:8000
  npm run build      # backend also serves ../mamacare-frontend/dist at /
